                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "A zombie survival game... in which your endgame goal is to build a car and drive around.... which you can do after roughly 30min of gameplay? My guy CLEARLY wanted to make a car game, which later he did (Barro series duh). \nAlso the screenshots on steam are a scam, the game doesnt even have grass, no shotgun, weird closed off map and scuffed asset flip graphic... Its like they accidently released one of the first ALfa test builds instead. Its not buggy and does work, but why play it.... Just go play 7days2die or anythign else really.",
